---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Research references under review | FairMind"
  description="FairMind's legacy research index is being checked before republication. Use the canonical P0 documentation and primary regulatory sources in the meantime."
  noindex={true}
>
  <section class="min-h-[70vh] bg-[#F3F5F0] text-[#0F1412] border-b-4 border-[#0F1412] py-24">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <p class="font-black tracking-[0.18em] uppercase mb-5">Reference boundary</p>
      <h1 class="text-5xl md:text-6xl font-black mb-8">RESEARCH INDEX UNDER REVIEW</h1>
      <p class="text-xl font-bold max-w-3xl mb-12">
        The earlier reference inventory mixed incomplete and mismatched citation metadata. It is not release evidence and has been withdrawn from indexing until every record is verified against its primary source.
      </p>

      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
        <a href="https://github.com/adhit-r/fairmind/tree/main/apps/docs/content/docs" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="block bg-white border-4 border-[#0F1412] p-6 shadow-[6px_6px_0px_0px_#0F766E] hover:-translate-y-1 transition-transform">
          <span class="block text-sm font-black uppercase mb-2">Canonical release guidance</span>
          <span class="block text-2xl font-black">P0 documentation</span>
        </a>
        <a href="https://eur-lex.europa.eu/eli/reg/2024/1689/oj?locale=en" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="block bg-[#FF6B35] border-4 border-[#0F1412] p-6 shadow-[6px_6px_0px_0px_#0F1412] hover:-translate-y-1 transition-transform">
          <span class="block text-sm font-black uppercase mb-2">Primary legal source</span>
          <span class="block text-2xl font-black">EU AI Act text</span>
        </a>
      </div>

      <p class="mt-12 text-base font-bold">
        FairMind documentation explains evidence mappings only. It does not provide legal advice, determine applicability, or establish compliance.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
